\n\nThis PR bumps `[project].version` to `0.38.31` and re-locks `uv.lock`, so the gate is disarmed by the same flow that armed it rather than by whichever unrelated PR trips it first.\n\n## Ticket\n\nOMN-13912 — release train must auto-bump project.version post-publish.\n\n## Triggered by\n\nRelease workflow: https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/actions/runs/35229459615\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] `release-identity` is green on this PR (that IS the behaviour under test)\n- [ ] CI passes (lockfile resolves, version matrix in sync)\n\nEvidence-Ticket: OMN-13912\nEvidence-Source: OCC#10008\n","created_at":"2026-09-17T13:50:45Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T14:52:50Z","closed_at":"2026-09-17T14:52:49Z","merged_at":"2026-09-17T14:52:49Z","merge_commit_sha":"695305b303dfd1e1d1b68a2885ea34641cd251ea","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/pulls/3693/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/pulls/3693/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/issues/3693/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/statuses/3cfc11318418158e442c27ea00397a5c92529466","head":{"label":"OmniNode-ai:automation/post-release-dev-bump-0.38.31","ref":"automation/post-release-dev-bump-0.38.31","sha":"3cfc11318418158e442c27ea00397a5c92529466","user":{"login":"OmniNode-ai","id":209038818,"node_id":"O_kgDODHWt4g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209038818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OmniNode-ai","html_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OmniNode-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OmniNode-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_ur